run 42264822833 annotation: [.github:69] Java heap space أثناء :app:checkKotlinGradlePluginConfigurationErrors
لأن apps/*/gradle.properties لا يضبط ذاكرة Gradle/kapt على runner بـ 7GB.

- org.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx3g -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=1g
- kotlin.daemon.jvm.options=-Xmx1536m + kapt في عملية منفصلة
- parallel + build cache (تسريع الدمج المتتابع للتطبيقين)

لأجهزة أضعف: ./scripts/build-apk.sh debug <app> --low-memory

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit d52e3111fed83d4ef762d38087917bc992b91f1d)
---
 apps/marketer/gradle.properties        | 8 ++++++++
 apps/orders-delivery/gradle.properties | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/apps/marketer/gradle.properties b/apps/marketer/gradle.properties
index 0695add..8b1f44a 100644
--- a/apps/marketer/gradle.properties
+++ b/apps/marketer/gradle.properties
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
 android.useAndroidX=true
 android.enableJetifier=true
 kotlin.code.style=official
+
+# ── تصحيح الوكيل 3/الوكيل 1: CI كان يفشل بـ «Java heap space» ──────────────
+org.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx3g -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=1g -Dfile.encoding=UTF-8
+kotlin.daemon.jvm.options=-Xmx1536m
+kapt.use.worker.api=true
+kapt.workers.isolation=process
+org.gradle.parallel=true
+org.gradle.caching=true
diff --git a/apps/orders-delivery/gradle.properties b/apps/orders-delivery/gradle.properties
index 0695add..8b1f44a 100644
--- a/apps/orders-delivery/gradle.properties
+++ b/apps/orders-delivery/gradle.properties
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
 android.useAndroidX=true
 android.enableJetifier=true
 kotlin.code.style=official
+
+# ── تصحيح الوكيل 3/الوكيل 1: CI كان يفشل بـ «Java heap space» ──────────────
+org.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx3g -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=1g -Dfile.encoding=UTF-8
+kotlin.daemon.jvm.options=-Xmx1536m
+kapt.use.worker.api=true
+kapt.workers.isolation=process
+org.gradle.parallel=true
+org.gradle.caching=true
